XYZ.DOMAIN.NAME.
Instead of sending mail to ABC@XYZ.DOMAIN.NAME, we need mail to be sent
to
ABC@DOMIAN.NAME, and still mail server XYZ can recieve it.
We are running DNS Server on DU4.0D. Is there any modifications to be
done to
the hosts.db ?

