Subject: SUMMARY: odd yp warning
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96079034715947

Thanks to "Sean O'Connell" <sean@stat.Duke.EDU>, who writes:

   In /var/yp/Makefile

   #-----------------------------------------------------------------#
   #YPPUSH=$(YPDIR)/yppush
   # the -M flag stops the complaints about ypslaves map not found
   # - seems to disable the undocumented multiple tree feature
   #-----------------------------------------------------------------#
   YPPUSH=$(YPDIR)/yppush -M
   #YPPUSH=$(YPDIR)/yppush

I tried it, and the ypslaves errors went away.

