Hello again.

I have been brainstorming with a few people and I have found a solution to
the problem I was experiencing.  This solution works in both SSH 1.2.26
(not 1.2.27, as I was delusional that day) and SSH 2.0.11.

In SSH 1.2.26 adding the -DHAVE_STRUCT_SPWD_EXPIRE to the Makefile in the
top of the SSH tree with fix the problem.

In SSH 2.0.11 adding the same -DHAVE_STRUCT_SPWD_EXPIRE to
ssh-2.0.11/lib/sshsession/Makefile.  In both case, I added it to the 'defs
=' section and it worked fine, but maybe there is a cleaner way to do
this.

In regards to -with-login, I have tried it and gotten errors not allowing
me to login at all.  I do not remember the exact problem, but I know it
did not work.  (I am too lazy right now to replicate the error).

