Summary Boot parameter

Question

How can I change the boot parameter to single user while in multi-user
level? 
Therefore, after the next boot the machine would come up in single user
mode.

Answers
 1. 	consvar -l # list the current configuration.
	consvar -s boot_osflags s # changes the parameter.
