My problem: all of a sudden, the g++ compiler (cc1plus) had disappeared.

I suspected that this was the result of the installation of gnat (the
GNU ADA compiler)

M-C. Vialatte confirmed that her gcc++ configuration had been screwed up
after having installed gnat.

