To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: [Summary] pure poison
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96079034715825

Hi Gurus,

Many thanks to the nice people bellow, some of them fellow physicists and/or
sys administrators who have passed by security problems in their boxes and 
have given their solidarity:

Dave Wolinski <wolinski@umaxp1.physics.lsa.umich.edu>
Paul Scowen <scowen@asu.edu>
"Sean O'Connell" <sean@stat.Duke.EDU>
