another response:
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sorry not to answer this before the summary appeared, but if the string
you refer to is the one that appears when you telnet to the system, it
is trivial to change, in /etc/gettydefs you can replace the string with
anything you like, it goes in the "default" entry.  Here is what ours
