Problem: When running verify command on DU 4.0B patch kit 7 prior to
upgrading to DU 4.0D system crashed.

Thanks to
	Chris Glenister
	Richard L Jackson Jr
	Joel_Gallun
for their suggestions. It seems that I'm not the only person to hit
this problem, but none of my respondents had managed to find a good
answer. I decided to log a support call, and DEC came up trumps. The
cause is a bug in 4.0B fixed in patch kit 8. So the recommended
upgrade path is
	install 4.0B patch kit 8
	run verify command on all your ADVFS domains
	upgrade to 4.0D

Cheers,
Bob
