I was getting "Permission denied" error messages when I ran ping, even
as root.

Although ping was still suid, its owner had accidentally been changed
from root to some random user.  So even when run by root, it ran with
the privileges of the normal user.  I have chowned it back to root and
now everything is back to normal.

Thanks to Andy Walden for putting me on the right track.

Michael

