I'd like to thank those of you who provided advice:
Mike D Cross
Alan Davis             
Joel Gallun
Viktor Holmberg
Richard L Jackson Jr
Bryan Lavelle

The consensus was that in order to avoid possible catastrophic problems
with our upgrade, we should run verify.  It's not a step you want to skip.

So, we scheduled a downtime, and ran verify on all of our AdvFS domains.
We were quite pleased with the process - verify ran extremely fast, even
on our largest domain.  We verified all of our filesystems in about three
hours.

Thanks again - this list is an excellent resource!

